  Enhancing this artifact taught me how to integrate secure authorization into an 
  existing full‑stack system. I learned how to structure middleware effectively, 
  manage JWT tokens, and enforce role‑based restrictions across the API. One of the 
  challenges I faced was ensuring that the Angular frontend correctly handled 
  restricted UI elements based on user roles. Through debugging and iterative testing, 
  I improved both the backend logic and the user experience. This enhancement 
  strengthened my understanding of secure software design and prepared me for 
  real‑world full‑stack development.

